BREAK_LUNCH_60MIN,sbosSeeds.D4.policy,sbosSeeds.D4.policy.break_lunch_60min,4,1,0,policy,,{D4},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,Ley General del Trabajo Bolivia,,,"{""rule"": ""breaks"", ""lunch_window"": ""12:00-14:00"", ""short_breaks"": 2, ""lunch_duration"": 60, ""lunch_required"": true, ""short_break_duration"": 15}",{},{},,Almuerzo obligatorio de 60min entre 12:00-14:00. 2 breaks cortos de 15min.,,,,,,,,,
SESSION_TIMEOUT_8H,sbosSeeds.D4.policy,sbosSeeds.D4.policy.session_timeout_8h,4,1,0,policy,,{D4},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,NIST SP 800-63B-4 §7,,,"{""rule"": ""session_timeout"", ""max_seconds"": 28800, ""force_logout_end_shift"": true}",{},{},,Duración máxima de sesión laboral. Force logout al fin del turno.,,,,,,,,,
fingerprint_capture,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.fingerprint_capture,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"NIST SP 800-76-2, NIST IR 8382 (NFIQ2), ISO/IEC 19794-2:2011, ISO/IEC 29794-4:2017",,,"{""_sources"": {""minutiae_min"": ""FBI EBTS §7.7"", ""min_nfiq2_score"": ""NIST IR 8382 §4 — umbral operativo SBOS"", ""template_format"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-2:2011"", ""max_enroll_samples"": ""NIST SP 800-76-2 §3.1.3 — múltiples muestras enrollment"", ""min_resolution_dpi"": ""NIST SP 800-76-2 §3.1.1""}, ""minutiae_min"": 12, ""sensor_types"": [""capacitive"", ""optical"", ""ultrasonic""], ""min_nfiq2_score"": 60, ""template_format"": ""ISO_19794_2_2011"", ""max_enroll_samples"": 3, ""min_resolution_dpi"": 500, ""finger_index_default"": [""right_index"", ""left_index""]}",{},{},,Captura de huella dactilar. Sensor ≥500 DPI (NIST SP 800-76-2). Calidad NFIQ2 ≥60/100 (NIST IR 8382). ≥12 minutiae (FBI EBTS §7.7). Template en formato ISO/IEC 19794-2:2011. 3 muestras para enrolamiento (NIST SP 800-76-2 §3.1.3).,,,,,,,,,
face_recognition,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.face_recognition,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 19794-5:2011, ISO/IEC 29794-5:2010, ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023",,,"{""_sources"": {""template_format"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-5:2011"", ""deepfake_detection"": ""ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 §5.3 — PA-2 digital injection"", ""pose_tolerance_deg_3d_live"": ""Práctica de industria 3D — no mandato ISO"", ""min_interocular_distance_px"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-5:2011 §6.3 — IED min 90 px"", ""pose_tolerance_deg_iso_token"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-5:2011 §5.2 — ±5° token frontal""}, ""prefer_3d"": true, ""modalities"": [""3d_structured_light"", ""3d_tof""], ""template_format"": ""ISO_19794_5_2011"", ""quality_standard"": ""ISO_29794_5"", ""deepfake_detection"": true, ""fallback_2d_nir_allowed"": false, ""pose_tolerance_deg_3d_live"": 15, ""min_interocular_distance_px"": 90, ""pose_tolerance_deg_iso_token"": 5}",{},{},,Reconocimiento facial 3D. IED mínimo 90 px (ISO/IEC 19794-5 §6.3). Token frontal ISO: ±5°. Captura 3D en vivo: tolerancia ±15°. Detección deepfake obligatoria (ISO 30107-3:2023 §5.3 ataques PA-2). 2D sin NIR no habilitado como método primario. Template: ISO/IEC 19794-5:2011.,,,,,,,,,
iris_recognition,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.iris_recognition,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 19794-6:2011, ISO/IEC 29794-6:2015",,,"{""_sources"": {""camera_spectrum"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-6:2011 §5.1 — 700-900 nm NIR"", ""template_format"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-6:2011"", ""pupil_iris_ratio"": ""ISO/IEC 29794-6:2015 métrica PUPIL_IRIS_RATIO"", ""min_resolution_lpmm"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-6:2011 §6.2 — 2 lp/mm al 60% contraste""}, ""contrast_pct"": 60, ""camera_spectrum"": ""nir_850nm"", ""glasses_allowed"": false, ""template_format"": ""ISO_19794_6_2011"", ""pupil_iris_ratio"": {""max"": 0.7, ""min"": 0.2}, ""quality_standard"": ""ISO_29794_6"", ""contact_lens_flag"": ""warn_and_log"", ""spectral_range_nm"": {""max"": 900, ""min"": 700}, ""min_resolution_lpmm"": 2}",{},{},,Reconocimiento de iris con cámara NIR 700–900 nm (ISO/IEC 19794-6 §5.1). PUPIL_IRIS_RATIO entre 0.2–0.7 (ISO/IEC 29794-6 métrica Q3). Resolución mínima 2 lp/mm al 60% contraste (ISO/IEC 19794-6 §6.2). Template: ISO/IEC 19794-6:2011.,,,,,,,,,
voice_verification,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.voice_verification,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 19794-13:2018, NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2, ITU-T P.563",,,"{""channel"": ""telephony_narrowband_g711"", ""max_aal"": ""AAL2"", ""_sources"": {""max_aal"": ""SBOS-decisión: NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2 no certifica voz AAL3"", ""min_snr_db"": ""ITU-T P.563 §4 — SNR mínimo calidad de habla"", ""template_format"": ""ISO/IEC 19794-13:2018"", ""feature_extraction"": ""ETSI STQ WG2 — práctica GMM-UBM 13+13+13 MFCC""}, ""min_snr_db"": 20, ""use_as_primary"": false, ""template_format"": ""ISO_19794_13"", ""use_as_secondary"": true, ""feature_extraction"": ""MFCC_39"", ""sample_max_seconds"": 10, ""sample_min_seconds"": 3}",{},{},,Verificación de voz. SNR ≥20 dB (ITU-T P.563 §4). MFCC-39 extracción de características (práctica ETSI STQ WG2). Solo como factor secundario — máximo AAL2 (SBOS-decisión basada en NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2). No certificable AAL3 por vulnerabilidad a replay sin hardware vinculado.,,,,,,,,,
template_storage,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.template_storage,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 24745:2022, OWASP Password Storage Cheat Sheet 2024, NIST SP 800-38D, NIST SP 800-88r2",,,"{""_sources"": {""hash_algorithm"": ""OWASP Password Storage Cheat Sheet 2024"", ""deletion_method"": ""NIST SP 800-88r2 §2.5 — crypto-erase para SSD/NVMe"", ""store_hash_only"": ""ISO/IEC 24745:2022 §6.2 — never store raw biometric"", ""argon2_memory_kb"": ""OWASP 2024 — m=64 MiB (65536 KiB) perfil recomendado"", ""argon2_time_cost"": ""OWASP 2024 — t=3 perfil recomendado"", ""argon2_salt_bytes"": ""OWASP — mínimo 16 bytes (128 bits)"", ""argon2_parallelism"": ""SBOS-decisión — p=2 > p=1 mínimo OWASP"", ""encryption_at_rest"": ""NIST SP 800-38D — GCM autenticado""}, ""hash_algorithm"": ""Argon2id"", ""key_vault_path"": ""bauth/biometric/template-key"", ""store_template"": false, ""deletion_method"": ""cryptographic_erasure"", ""store_hash_only"": true, ""argon2_memory_kb"": 65536, ""argon2_time_cost"": 3, ""argon2_hash_bytes"": 32, ""argon2_salt_bytes"": 16, ""argon2_parallelism"": 2, ""encryption_at_rest"": ""AES-256-GCM"", ""store_raw_biometric"": false}",{},{},,"Solo se almacena el hash Argon2id de la plantilla — nunca la biométrica cruda (ISO/IEC 24745:2022 §6.2). Argon2id: t=3, m=64 MiB, p=2, sal=16 bytes, hash=32 bytes (OWASP 2024). Cifrado adicional AES-256-GCM en reposo (NIST SP 800-38D). Borrado: crypto-erase (NIST SP 800-88r2 §2.5 — único método válido para SSD/NVMe).",,,,,,,,,
liveness_detection,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.liveness_detection,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023, ISO/IEC 30107-1:2016",,,"{""_sources"": {""pad_level"": ""ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 — Level 2 iBeta"", ""attack_types"": ""ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 §5.3 categorías PA-1..PA-4"", ""passive_liveness"": ""ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 §5.2"", ""max_apcer_operational"": ""SBOS-decisión — más estricto que Level 2 (≤15%)"", ""max_bpcer_operational"": ""SBOS-decisión — igual a Level 2 iBeta""}, ""fail_action"": ""DENY_AND_ALERT_SIEM"", ""attack_types_covered"": [""print_attack"", ""replay_attack"", ""3d_mask"", ""digital_injection_deepfake""], ""max_apcer_operational"": 0.01, ""max_bpcer_operational"": 0.05, ""ibeta_level2_apcer_ref"": 0.15, ""active_liveness_enabled"": false, ""pad_level_iso_reference"": 2, ""passive_liveness_enabled"": true, ""pad_level_sbos_deployment"": ""stricter_than_ibeta_level_2""}",{},{},,"Detección de vida anti-spoofing ISO 30107-3:2023. PAD Level 2 (referencia iBeta). APCER operacional ≤1% (más estricto que certificación Level 2 iBeta: ≤15%). BPCER operacional ≤5%. Liveness pasiva (sin desafío activo). Tipos de ataque: print, replay, 3D mask, deepfake/digital injection. Nota: APCER/BPCER son umbrales de despliegue SBOS, ISO 30107-3 define las métricas y metodología de prueba pero no fija valores de despliegue.",,,,,,,,,
quality_threshold,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.quality_threshold,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"NIST IR 8382 (NFIQ2), ISO/IEC 29794-1:2024, ISO/IEC 29794-4:2017, ISO/IEC 29794-5:2010, ISO/IEC 29794-6:2015, ITU-T P.563",,,"{""_sources"": {""max_retries"": ""ISO/IEC 29794-1:2024 §7 — reintentos permitidos"", ""voice_snr_min_db"": ""ITU-T P.563 §4"", ""face_quality_min_sbos"": ""ISO/IEC 29794-5:2010 framework — umbral 70 = SBOS-decisión"", ""fingerprint_nfiq2_min"": ""NIST IR 8382 — algoritmo NFIQ2; umbral 60 = SBOS-decisión"", ""iris_quality_min_sbos"": ""ISO/IEC 29794-6:2015 framework — umbral 65 = SBOS-decisión""}, ""voice_snr_min_db"": 20, ""low_quality_action"": ""RETRY_WITH_GUIDANCE"", ""max_retries_on_low_q"": 3, ""face_quality_min_sbos"": 70, ""fail_action_after_max"": ""DENY_AND_LOG"", ""fingerprint_nfiq2_min"": 60, ""iris_quality_min_sbos"": 65}",{},{},,"Umbrales de calidad de muestra biométrica. Huella NFIQ2 ≥60 (NIST IR 8382 algoritmo; umbral es decisión SBOS). Rostro ≥70, Iris ≥65 (ISO/IEC 29794 framework; valores son decisión SBOS). Voz SNR ≥20 dB (ITU-T P.563). Máximo 3 reintentos por muestra de baja calidad.",,,,,,,,,
enrollment_process,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.enrollment_process,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"NIST SP 800-76-2, NIST SP 800-63A-4, GDPR Art.9, ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023",,,"{""_sources"": {""ial_minimum"": ""NIST SP 800-63A-4 §4.4 — Identity Assurance Level 2"", ""min_samples_face"": ""SBOS-decisión — práctica industria 3D"", ""min_samples_iris"": ""SBOS-decisión — 1 por ojo mínimo"", ""supervisor_required"": ""NIST SP 800-63A-4 §4.4.1 — IAL2 presencia supervisada"", ""user_consent_required"": ""GDPR Art.9(2)(a) — consentimiento explícito biométrico"", ""min_samples_fingerprint"": ""NIST SP 800-76-2 §3.1.3 — ≥3 muestras enrollment""}, ""ial_minimum"": 2, ""approval_mode"": ""hybrid"", ""min_samples_face"": 5, ""min_samples_iris"": 2, ""consent_revocable"": true, ""supervisor_required"": true, ""user_consent_required"": true, ""enrollment_ttl_minutes"": 30, ""max_concurrent_sessions"": 1, ""min_samples_fingerprint"": 3}",{},{},,Proceso de enrolamiento biométrico. Huella: 3 muestras (NIST SP 800-76-2 §3.1.3). Supervisor obligatorio (IAL2 — NIST SP 800-63A-4 §4.4.1). Consentimiento explícito y revocable (GDPR Art.9(2)(a)). Sesión de enrolamiento: máximo 30 minutos.,,,,,,,,,
biometric_system,sbosSeeds.D5.config,sbosSeeds.D5.config.biometric_system,4,1,0,group,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO 27001:2022 A.8.22, ISO/IEC 24745:2022, GDPR Art.9, GDPR Art.44, NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2",,,"{""_sources"": {""data_residency"": ""SBOS-soberanía + GDPR Art.44 — sin transferencia internacional"", ""enabled_methods"": ""SBOS-decisión: voz deshabilitada por riesgo replay"", ""audit_biometric_events"": ""ISO 27001:2022 A.8.15 — registro de eventos de acceso"", ""revocation_max_seconds"": ""SBOS-SLA — NIST SP 800-53 AC-2(2) provee base""}, ""data_residency"": ""tenant_server_only"", ""enabled_methods"": [""FINGERPRINT"", ""FACE_3D"", ""IRIS""], ""disabled_methods"": [""VOICE""], ""cross_tenant_share"": false, ""compliance_frameworks"": [""ISO_27001_2022_A8_22"", ""GDPR_Art9"", ""NIST_SP_800_63B4"", ""ISO_IEC_24745_2022""], ""max_enrolled_per_user"": 3, ""audit_biometric_events"": true, ""revocation_max_seconds"": 30, ""external_service_allowed"": false}",{},{},,"Parámetros globales del subsistema biométrico SBOS. Métodos habilitados: huella, rostro 3D, iris (voz deshabilitada). Revocación en <30 s (SBOS-SLA). Auditoría de eventos biométricos (ISO 27001:2022 A.8.15). Datos exclusivamente en servidor del tenant — soberanía total (GDPR Art.44).",,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_LIVENESS_PASSIVE,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_liveness_passive,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023, NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3",,,"{""rule"": ""liveness_required"", ""method"": ""passive"", ""fail_action"": ""DENY_AND_ALERT_SIEM"", ""applies_to_aal"": [""AAL2"", ""AAL3""], ""_source_pad_level"": ""ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 metodología iBeta Level 2"", ""ibeta_pad_level_ref"": 2}",{},{},,Verificación de vida sin desafío activo. Anti-spoofing ISO 30107-3:2023 obligatorio para todos los métodos biométricos en SBOS. Applies to AAL2 y AAL3. Ataque detectado: DENY + alerta SIEM.,,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_FMR_1_10000,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_fmr_1_10000,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3,,,"{""rule"": ""fmr_threshold"", ""_source"": ""NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3 (Aug 2024) — cita textual"", ""fmr_max"": ""1:10000"", ""fnmr_max_pct"": 5, ""applies_to_aal"": ""AAL2""}",{},{},,"False Match Rate máximo 1:10,000 para Authentication Assurance Level 2. Requisito textual de NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3 (agosto 2024). FNMR (False Non-Match Rate) máximo 5% en el mismo estándar.",,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_FMR_1_100000,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_fmr_1_100000,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3, IEC 60839-11-5",,,"{""rule"": ""fmr_threshold"", ""_source"": ""NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3 (Aug 2024) — cita textual"", ""fmr_max"": ""1:100000"", ""fnmr_max_pct"": 10, ""applies_to_aal"": ""AAL3""}",{},{},,"False Match Rate máximo 1:100,000 para Authentication Assurance Level 3. Requisito textual de NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3 (agosto 2024). Obligatorio para bóvedas, servidores, data centers. Debe combinarse con Two-Person Rule (ath_policy_d2) en zonas críticas.",,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_GDPR_CONSENT,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_gdpr_consent,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"GDPR Art.9, GDPR Art.17, ISO 27701:2019, ISO/IEC 24745:2022",,,"{""rule"": ""gdpr_consent"", ""revocable"": true, ""legal_basis"": ""explicit_consent_Art9_2_a"", ""no_profiling"": true, ""data_category"": ""GDPR_Art9_special"", ""storage_format"": ""Argon2id_hash_only"", ""_source_consent"": ""GDPR Art.9(2)(a)"", ""_source_storage"": ""ISO/IEC 24745:2022 §6.2"", ""requires_explicit"": true, ""purpose_limitation"": ""ACCESS_CONTROL_ONLY""}",{},{},,"Datos biométricos son categoría especial GDPR Art.9(1). Solo tratables con consentimiento explícito Art.9(2)(a). El titular puede retirar el consentimiento → derecho de supresión Art.17(1)(b). Propósito único: control de acceso (no perfilado, no inferencia de salud/raza). Almacenamiento: solo hash Argon2id (ISO/IEC 24745:2022 §6.2).",,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_ALTERNATIVE_REQUIRED,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_alternative_required,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3, NIST SP 800-63A-4 §5.1",,,"{""rule"": ""fallback_required"", ""_source"": ""NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3 — fallback authenticator SHALL be available"", ""alert_at_use"": 3, ""fallback_method"": ""QR_DYNAMIC_OTP"", ""fallback_aal_max"": ""AAL2"", ""max_uses_per_day"": 5}",{},{},,NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3: siempre debe existir un método alternativo no biométrico disponible. En SBOS: QR dinámico de un solo uso (OTP). Máximo 5 usos de alternativa por día antes de disparar revisión de acceso. La biometría nunca es el ÚNICO factor — siempre se usa con otro.,,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_MULTIMODAL_OPTIONAL,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_multimodal_optional,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3, ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 §4.3, NIST SP 800-53 AC-3",,,"{""rule"": ""multimodal_biometric"", ""_source_nist"": ""NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3"", ""_source_fusion"": ""ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 §4.3"", ""fusion_strategy"": ""AND"", ""required_factors"": 2, ""min_aal_to_activate"": 3, ""role_flag_activator"": ""require_multimodal"", ""allowed_combinations"": [[""FINGERPRINT"", ""FACE_3D""], [""FINGERPRINT"", ""IRIS""], [""FACE_3D"", ""IRIS""]]}",{},{},,Combinación de dos biométricos (huella + rostro 3D) para escenarios AAL3 reforzado. No obligatorio a menos que el rol tenga require_multimodal=true. Fusión en modo AND: ambos biométricos deben superar sus umbrales FMR. NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3 permite múltiples biométricos dentro de hardware-bound auth.,,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_TEMPLATE_REVOCATION,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_template_revocation,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 24745:2022, NIST SP 800-53 Rev.5 AC-2(2), GDPR Art.17",,,"{""rule"": ""template_revocation"", ""state_on_revoke"": ""REVOKED_NOT_DELETED"", ""_source_sbos_sla"": ""SBOS-SLA 30s — más estricto que AC-2(2) NIST"", ""_source_deactivation"": ""ISO/IEC 24745:2022 §7.4"", ""audit_revocation_event"": true, ""max_revocation_seconds"": 30, ""physical_deletion_days"": 30, ""propagate_to_d2_readers"": true, ""revocation_reason_codes"": [""OFFBOARDING"", ""CONSENT_WITHDRAWN"", ""SECURITY_INCIDENT"", ""USER_REQUEST""]}",{},{},,"Al desvincularse un usuario, su plantilla biométrica se marca REVOKED en ≤30 s. La plantilla no se borra físicamente hasta el período de retención GDPR/ISO, pero no puede ser comparada con ninguna muestra nueva. Propagación a todos los readers físicos D2 en el mismo SLA. ISO/IEC 24745:2022 §7.4: biometric template deactivation on consent withdrawal.",,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_QUALITY_MINIMUM,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_quality_minimum,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 29794-1:2024, NIST IR 8382 (NFIQ2), ISO/IEC 29794-4:2017",,,"{""rule"": ""quality_minimum"", ""max_retries"": 3, ""_source_voice"": ""ITU-T P.563 §4"", ""reject_action"": ""RETRY_WITH_GUIDANCE"", ""voice_snr_min_db"": 20, ""_source_face_iris"": ""ISO/IEC 29794 framework — umbrales son SBOS-decisión"", ""_source_fingerprint"": ""NIST IR 8382 — umbral 60 = decisión SBOS"", ""face_quality_min_sbos"": 70, ""fingerprint_nfiq2_min"": 60, ""iris_quality_min_sbos"": 65, ""fail_after_max_retries"": ""DENY_ENROLLMENT""}",{},{},,Muestras con calidad inferior al umbral son rechazadas durante enrolamiento y verificación. 3 reintentos antes de denegar. Algoritmo NFIQ2 para huella (NIST IR 8382). Nota: umbrales para rostro e iris son decisión SBOS dentro del framework ISO/IEC 29794; la norma define métricas pero no fija valores universales.,,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_SPOOFING_MANDATORY_AAL3,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_spoofing_mandatory_aal3,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023, NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3",,,"{""rule"": ""pad_mandatory"", ""fail_action"": ""DENY_REVOKE_SESSION_ALERT_SIEM"", ""_source_nist"": ""NIST SP 800-63B-4 §5.2.3 — PAD SHALL be implemented"", ""applies_to_aal"": ""AAL3"", ""_note_thresholds"": ""APCER/BPCER son umbrales de despliegue SBOS, más estrictos que certificación"", ""_source_pad_level"": ""ISO/IEC 30107-3:2023 §7 — iBeta Level 2"", ""attack_categories"": [""print_attack"", ""replay_attack"", ""3d_mask"", ""digital_injection_deepfake""], ""ibeta_level_reference"": 2, ""sbos_apcer_operational"": 0.01, ""sbos_bpcer_operational"": 0.05, ""ibeta_level2_apcer_threshold"": 0.15}",{},{},,"Para zonas AAL3 (bóvedas, servidores, data centers) la detección PAD es obligatoria. Referencia ISO 30107-3:2023 Level 2 (metodología iBeta: APCER ≤15%). Umbral de despliegue SBOS más estricto: APCER ≤1%, BPCER ≤5%. Ataques cubiertos: print, replay, 3D mask, deepfake/digital injection. Detección de ataque: DENY + cierre de sesión activa + alerta SIEM.",,,,,,,,,
BIOMETRIC_RETENTION_LIMIT,sbosSeeds.D5.policy,sbosSeeds.D5.policy.biometric_retention_limit,4,1,0,policy,,{D5},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"GDPR Art.5, GDPR Art.17, ISO 27001:2022 A.8.10, NIST SP 800-88r2",,,"{""rule"": ""retention_limit"", ""no_profiling"": true, ""audit_deletion"": true, ""_note_72h_error"": ""72h es GDPR Art.33 brecha, NO Art.17 supresión"", ""deletion_method"": ""cryptographic_erasure"", ""_source_retention"": ""GDPR Art.5(1)(e) — limitación del plazo"", ""max_retention_days"": 365, ""purpose_limitation"": ""ACCESS_CONTROL_ONLY"", ""_source_user_deletion"": ""GDPR Art.17 — without undue delay = 30 días práctica UE"", ""auto_delete_on_expiry"": true, ""_source_deletion_method"": ""NIST SP 800-88r2 §2.5 — crypto-erase para SSD/NVMe"", ""inactivity_trigger_days"": 365, ""user_deletion_response_days"": 30}",{},{},,"Los datos biométricos (hash de plantilla) se retienen máximo 365 días desde el último uso activo (GDPR Art.5(1)(e) — limitación del plazo de conservación). Solicitud de supresión por el usuario → respuesta ≤30 días (GDPR Art.17 — ""without undue delay"" = práctica europea 1 mes). NOTA: 72 horas es GDPR Art.33 (notificación de brecha a DPA), NO el plazo del Art.17. Método de borrado: crypto-erasure (NIST SP 800-88r2 §2.5 — único válido para SSD). Propósito: exclusivamente control de acceso.",,,,,,,,,
geolocation_access_controls_d6,sbosSeeds.D6.config,sbosSeeds.D6.config.geolocation_access_controls_d6,4,1,0,group,,{D6},sbos_seeds_v1_2026,"GDPR Art 44-49, NIS 2 Directive",,,"{""description"": ""Location-based access control and geo-fencing for D6 Geolocalización domain"", ""geo_fencing"": {""enabled"": true, ""signals"": {""gps"": {""enabled"": true, ""description"": ""Precise device GPS coordinates"", ""precision_meters"": 10}, ""ip_geolocation"": {""enabled"": true, ""provider"": ""MaxMind GeoIP2"", ""description"": ""IP-based country/city detection at edge gateway""}, ""device_metadata"": {""enabled"": true, ""description"": ""Device-reported timezone, locale, region""}, ""wifi_triangulation"": {""enabled"": true, ""description"": ""Indoor location for offices and facilities""}, ""network_geolocation"": {""enabled"": true, ""description"": ""Secure network-based location verification""}}, ""anti_spoofing"": {""tls_mandatory"": true, ""vpn_proxy_detection"": true, ""gps_spoofing_detection"": true, ""never_trust_client_headers"": true, ""trusted_geolocation_databases_only"": true}}, ""data_sovereignty"": {""dora"": {""enforceable"": ""2025-01"", ""financial_sector_sovereignty"": true}, ""nis2_directive"": {""transposed"": ""2024-10"", ""supply_chain_sovereignty"": true}, ""post_schrems_ii"": {""description"": ""EDPB Recommendation 01/2020 — technical measure sufficient for CLOUD Act protection"", ""keys_held_exclusively_in_eea"": true, ""customer_controlled_encryption"": true}, ""gdpr_articles_44_49"": {""description"": ""Cross-border transfer restrictions"", ""adequacy_decisions_required"": true}}, ""region_aware_rbac"": {""rules"": [{""region"": ""eu_eea"", ""description"": ""GDPR personal data restricted to EEA"", ""allow_data_access"": true, ""require_eu_residency"": true}, {""region"": ""sanctioned_countries"", ""description"": ""OFAC sanctioned countries blocked at gateway"", ""http_response"": ""403 Forbidden"", ""allow_data_access"": false}, {""region"": 